description: Keep an admin-only /admin SQLite console on InPmnt.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Admin panel (`/admin`)

InPmnt PHP always exposes `/admin` for users with `role = admin`:

- Browse every SQLite table; create / edit / delete rows
- Run SQL (writes need confirm)
- Light / dark via `sessionStorage` (`inpmnt_admin_theme`) — per browser window

Do not remove `/admin` without Robert asking. Keep it gated.
